{
"Items.DesertRose.Desc": "Being a balled-up tumbleweed roughly the size of a fist, this is only a rose in name. Its branches are withered and dry, though these plants are known to miraculously spring back to false life when watered, giving the illusion of immortality."
"Items.DesertRose.Long": "a desert rose"
"Items.DesertRose.Short": "Desert Rose"
}
